Why do you need water-walking for dipping? It is useful,
yes. But all you need to do is drop all your rust-prone
objects and jump in the water unburdened.

(jump in with SDSM, rustproofed armor, and rustproofed
weapons at least, so you aren't defenseless).

You'll climb back out, but some of your items will be
blanked or diluted. It may take a while, but its
the sure-fire way of blanking stuff without water-boots.

And don't dip stuff into fountains unless you're ready
for the curses and such that come out of it. Its much
better to just dig up the fountain and fall in.

