Wish 1: Magic Marker
Write 2 blessed charging scrolls, and write many enchant
armor scrolls.

However; if you still got that /oPoly, get all
those spare unicorn horns, tools, spare BoH, bag of
tricks, etc etc and zap them. You have a good chance
of making a magic marker that way (something like
a 1/10 chance for each magical tool you zap)

And if you got a polymorph potion, it is always
worth a shot to dip a spare unicorn horn. (A SPARE,
you need at least 1 horn)

In the case you get a Magic Marker from polypile,
you should be able to easily get 3 charging
scrolls and recharge your /oWish and Magic Marker.

Wish 2: Magic Marker
Enchant the rest of your armor up. Do the method
I said earlier to dip scrolls (or just use
the water-walking boots) Uncursed Magic Marker can
write cursed scrolls. Blessed Magic Marker turns
uncursed scrolls into blessed ones.

Whichever one is more necessary, wish for it.

Wish 3: Magic Marker
Hey, you can only charge them once :-) Get
4+ Gold Detection scrolls for the endgame,
and a few ways of guarenteed confusion. Cursed
scrolls of confuse monster, or a forgotten
spell is all you need.

Write cursed genocide scrolls for Tengu, and
get intrinsic teleport control.

Enchant your armor upto +4 or +5, but no more.
Elven helms can become +6 or +7.

But seriously: if you are able to do it with
just 1 or 2 Magic Markers, you should be fine.

An Amulet of Life Saving would be a great wish
also, for obvious reasons. I am under the impression
that you have more than one... if you don't have
any, it should be a bigger priority. (you get
the one from Vlad's yet?)

Then save your wishes. In a sticky situation,
wish for a blessed cockatrice corpse and (carefully)
wreak havoc. Carefully means don't move into traps,
don't be burdened, etc. etc. The important thing
is to wish for something when you need it, not before
you need it. Right now, you need better AC, and
a Magic Marker is the best thing for that. Similarly,
you need some tengu to get Teleport Control, which
is also handled by a (uncursed) Magic Marker (write
cursed scrolls o Genocide). You also need the gold
detection scrolls, and a way to confuse yourself to
find the magic portals in the end-game. All of them
can be settled with a few magic markers.

Be sure you have 7 candles (definitely worth
a wish, as you can't win without them). And...
I can't really think of anything else.

